UISR BLOCKED (link#227) — 1 blocking dam(s) on UISR's downstream flow path have not been modelled yet.

link computes accessibility by reading ALREADY-PERSISTED downstream barriers.
Running UISR now would mark segments accessible that are in fact dammed off, and exit 0.

  persist schema : fresh_default
  unmodelled blocking dams downstream of UISR:
    ISKR  c548c09d-39ce-4c48-a590-d9c9fb334e0f   Forrest Kerr Generating Station (psc 1)
  model these first, DS-first: LSTR, LISR, ISKR

Fix — pick one:
  1. Model the downstream WSGs first:
       for w in LSTR LISR ISKR; do Rscript data-raw/wsg_run_one.R $w <config>; done
  2. Model UISR now and settle access after they land:
       Rscript data-raw/wsg_recompute_one.R UISR <config>
  3. Override, if those dams are known passable / remediated / irrelevant.
     Recorded in the run log and surfaced by lnk_log_read():
       LNK_GUARD_DOWNSTREAM_NOTE="..." Rscript data-raw/wsg_run_one.R UISR <config>

